          "start_ms": null,
          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Description: On August 4, 2007, around 2:00 PM, a family observed the movements of a small, bright sphere that varied in speed and changed direction. The level of strangeness of the observation is low: a high proportion of the characteristics described of the phenomenon correspond to those of known phenomena (balloon). The proposed interpretation is plausible to explain the observation. Although coming from a single testimony (questionnaire without a gendarmerie protocol), the quantity and quality of the information describing the observation are objective and reliable. The case is classified as B, indicating a very probable observation of a balloon.",
